                    "sense_definition": "In a way that seems to never end; constantly or without interruption.",
                    "learner_level": "B2",
                    "frequency": "Middle",
                    "semantic_group_id": "duration",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The two neighbors are <w>perpetually</w> arguing about the boundary of their gardens.",
