                                "zh": "那两个邻居<w>总是</w>在为花园的边界争吵。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "She felt <w>perpetually</w> tired because of her busy work schedule and lack of sleep.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "zh": "由于繁忙的工作日程和睡眠不足，她感到<w>不断地</w>疲惫。"
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "synonyms": [
                        "ceaselessly",
                        "incessantly",
                        "nonstop",
                        "continuously"
                    ],
                    "common_phrases": [
